TI  - In silico investigation of a HIV-1 Vpr inhibitor binding site: Potential for virtual screening and anti-HIV drug design
PY  - 2014
T2  - Molecular Informatics
VL  - 33
IS  - 11-12
SP  - 742
EP  - 748
